  data: {
    LLM: "Four betting phases per hand: Grande (high cards), Chica (low cards), Pares (pairs), and Juego/Punto (card combinations).\n\n1. Grande: Bet on having the highest cards\n2. Chica: Bet on having the lowest cards\n3. Pares: Bet on having pairs (only players with pairs participate)\n4. Juego/Punto: Bet on card point totals (31 is best juego, punto is fallback)\n\nBetting proceeds anticlockwise from the mano (player to dealer's right). Players can pass, bet (minimum 2), see, or raise (minimum increase of 2).",
    Player: "Four betting phases per hand: Grande (high cards), Chica (low cards), Pares (pairs), and Juego/Punto (card combinations).\n\n1. Grande: Bet on having the highest cards\n2. Chica: Bet on having the lowest cards\n3. Pares: Bet on having pairs (only players with pairs participate)\n4. Juego/Punto: Bet on card point totals (31 is best juego, punto is fallback)\n\nBetting proceeds anticlockwise from the mano (player to dealer's right). Players can pass, bet (minimum 2), see, or raise (minimum increase of 2).",
    objective: 'Be the first player to get rid of all your stones. The last player with stones remaining is the loser.',
    gameplay: "Four betting phases per hand: Grande (high cards), Chica (low cards), Pares (pairs), and Juego/Punto (card combinations).\n\n1. Grande: Bet on having the highest cards\n2. Chica: Bet on having the lowest cards\n3. Pares: Bet on having pairs (only players with pairs participate)\n4. Juego/Punto: Bet on card point totals (31 is best juego, punto is fallback)\n\nBetting proceeds anticlockwise from the mano (player to dealer's right). Players can pass, bet (minimum 2), see, or raise (minimum increase of 2).",
    keyRules: [
